      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey... i don't really know where to start. i told my parents i was gay three weeks ago and they told me i had to leave. like, packed my stuff and everything. i'm staying at my friend maya's place now but it doesn't feel real\n\ni keep thinking about how they looked at me. my mom couldn't even say my name when she said goodbye. three weeks and i haven't heard from them once\n\ni just... i don't think i can exist in a world where the people who made me don't want me. does that make sense? like i feel like i've been erased",
